sequenceDiagram
    participant Vendor as Vendor's inbox
    participant SES as Amazon SES
    participant S3 as S3: raw-emails
    participant SNS as SNS
    participant SQS as SQS + DLQ
    participant Svc as Service Lambda
    participant Idem as DynamoDB: Idempotency
    participant Agent as AgentCore Runtime (Strands Agent)
    participant RFQ as DynamoDB: RFQs / Quotes
    participant PO as DynamoDB: PurchaseOrders
    participant Buyer as Human buyer

    Vendor->>SES: replies to the RFQ email
    SES->>S3: store raw MIME
    SES->>SNS: notification (S3 key + metadata)
    SNS->>SQS: forward
    SQS->>Svc: deliver (batch size 1)
    Svc->>Idem: already processed this message-id?
    alt duplicate
        Svc-->>Svc: skip
    else new message
        Svc->>S3: fetch + parse raw MIME
        Svc->>Svc: correlate RFQ id from subject/body
        Svc->>Agent: invoke_agent_runtime(prompt + quote text)
        Agent->>RFQ: get_rfq(rfq_id) / get_vendor(vendor_id)
        Agent->>RFQ: record_quote(price, qty, lead_time, moq)
        alt vendor trusted and quote complete
            Agent->>PO: create_purchase_order()
            PO-->>Agent: PO issued, RFQ awarded, Inventory restocked
            Agent->>SES: send PO confirmation to vendor
        else vendor untrusted or terms missing
            Agent->>Buyer: notify_buyer(escalation email)
            Buyer->>Buyer: reviews RFQ on the dashboard
            Buyer->>PO: Approve or Reject (dashboard button)
        end
        Svc->>Agent: get response
        Svc->>SES: send agent's reply
        Svc->>Idem: mark message-id processed
    end
